  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">V&#xe4;nsterns Internationella Forum VIF infocomm 2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">V&#xe4;nsterns Internationella Forum VIF infokom 2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Infocom support to V&#xe4;nsterns Internationella Forum (VIF), affiliated  to the Swedish leftist party for a project in Sweden during 2013. The aim is to increase the knowledge about the countries that VIF is      working in, the conditions for Swedish development cooperation and    the relation between democratic participation (especially for women   and maginalized groups) and social/economic development.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Infokom st&#xf6;d till V&#xe4;nsterns Internationella Forum (VIF), med          anknutning till V&#xe4;nsterpartiet f&#xf6;r verksamhet i Sverige under 2013.   Syftet &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka kunskapen om de l&#xe4;nder VIF arbetar i, villkoren f&#xf6;r svenskt bist&#xe5;nd samt om sambandet mellan demokratiskt deltagande (i   synnerhet f&#xf6;r kvinnor &amp; marginaliserade grupper) och social och       ekonomisk utveckling.</narrative>
  </description>
